title Shared Office Room Booking

component room-booking-webapp as "Room Booking Web App" web-application
component room-booking-api as "Room Booking API" service
component booking-db as "Booking Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> room-booking-webapp
north -> room-booking-api

room-booking-webapp -> room-booking-api
room-booking-webapp -> user-auth
room-booking-api -> user-auth
room-booking-api -> booking-db
